{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Drive Me Broke \u2013 Coming Soon!</strong> \ud83c\udfc1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Your father lost his life in a racing accident when you were just a child\u2026<br>Now that you\u2019ve <strong>come of age</strong>, it\u2019s time to do what he couldn\u2019t!<br>\ud83c\udfaf You must win the <strong>gold trophy</strong> in <strong>3 different race types</strong>.<br>But remember \u2013 getting those trophies won\u2019t be easy\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Upgrade your car, earn money, and help people with their needs to <strong>gain their trust</strong>.<br>At the same time, don\u2019t forget to take care of your <strong>own basic needs</strong>:<br><strong>Healthy body, healthy mind!</strong> \ud83e\udd6a\ud83d\udca7\ud83d\ude34</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude98 <strong>Vehicle Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>50+ attachable parts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>3 types of bodykits</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699 Engine and exhaust parts of all qualities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce <strong>Realistic physics and driving experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Spray paints in various colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udede <strong>11 types of rims</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 Various steering wheels and seats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude82 <strong>4 different spoilers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>But you\u2019ll need money for all of them!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddcd <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 <strong>Hunger</strong>, \ud83d\udca7 <strong>Thirst</strong>, \ud83d\ude34 <strong>Fatigue</strong>, \u2764\ufe0f <strong>Will to Live</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1e Day/Night cycle &amp; \ud83c\udf27 Weather system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>20+ unique missions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3 <strong>11 interactive NPCs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 5\u201310 interactive buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce Racing track &amp; \ud83d\udea6 Drag strip</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Ways to Earn Money</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Fruit &amp; vegetable farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf77 Wine production &amp; smuggling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 Car towing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 Chicken farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267b Recycling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Tip:</strong> Keep good relationships with people \u2013 you might get unexpected favors! \ud83e\udd1d\u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958820?t=1767606455","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958820?t=1767606455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958820/165944c74502eb57db60b0492fede4bc4b9e4dd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767606455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958820/165944c74502eb57db60b0492fede4bc4b9e4dd5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767606455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4038450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Drive Me Broke \u2013 Coming Soon!</str