paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1e Day/Night cycle &amp; \ud83c\udf27 Weather system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>20+ unique missions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3 <strong>11 interactive NPCs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 5\u201310 interactive buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce Racing track &amp; \ud83d\udea6 Drag strip</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Ways to Earn Money</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Fruit &amp; vegetable farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf77 Wine production &amp; smuggling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 Car towing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14 Chicken farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267b Recycling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Tip:</strong> Keep good relationships with people \u2013 you might get unexpected favors! \ud83e\udd1d\u2728</p>","developers":["Onur AD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958820/2c0dce2f9937d080e5c22f6b1de3d22459e69b44/header.jpg?t=1767606455","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958820/1730628283/12173790ec1208ad08557992a25b0c67297f6d47/1764705519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764707784","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958820/1730628283/12173790ec1208ad08557992a25b0c67297f6d47/1764705519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764707784","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3958820/1730628283/12173790ec1208ad08557992a25b0c67297f6d47/1764705519/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764707784","id":257208914,"